  "description": "Completion replay for glimmer_hollow (Glimmer Hollow). Takes the tunnel crystal and digs the way into the ring (safe: it is on the glimmer's left). Steps in just after the glimmer passes heading east (tick 169) and goes the other way round, visiting the three pockets on the glimmer's left and waiting in two of them while it goes by. Leaves the ring, takes the far tunnel crystal and turns the vault valve (tick 547): the boulder drops into the open gate and shatters the boxed glimmer below (tick 550), leaving five crystals; the two below the vault walls fall into the basin (tick 556). Takes the two beside the gate and the two in the basin (the fifth stays sealed under the boulder); the seventh opens the exit (tick 595). Turns the sluice valve (tick 655): nine units of water drop into the corridor and drown its glimmer (tick 658), which leaves no crystals, settling 1,2,3,2,1 deep. Digs down, wades through and completes at tick 728. The ring glimmer survives.",
